     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CodeSystem ipccc</b></p><a name=\"ipccc\"> </a><a name=\"hcipccc\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://taussig/fhir/CodeSystem/ipccc</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Affichage</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.00<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4600\"> </a></td><td>Normal heart</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.01<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4601\"> </a></td><td>Tetralogy of Fallot</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.02<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4602\"> </a></td><td>Transposition of the great arteries with concordant atrioventricular connections and intact ventricular septum</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.03<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4603\"> </a></td><td>Congenitally corrected transposition of great arteries (discordant atrioventricular &amp; ventriculo-arterial connections)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.04<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4604\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.06<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4606\"> </a></td><td>Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD) (including Fallot type)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.07<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4607\"> </a></td><td>Pulmonary atresia with intact ventricular septum</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.09<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4609\"> </a></td><td>Hypoplastic left heart syndrome</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.10<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4610\"> </a></td><td>Transposition of the great arteries with concordant atrioventricular connections and ventricular septal defect</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.14<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4614\"> </a></td><td>Double inlet atrioventricular connection (double inlet ventricle)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.16<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4616\"> </a></td><td>Partial anomalous pulmonary venous connection of Scimitar type</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.17<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4617\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle with subaortic or doubly committed ventricular septal defect and pulmonary stenosis, Fallot type</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.18<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4618\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle with subpulmonary ventricular septal defect, transposition type</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.19<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4619\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle with non-committed ventricular septal defect</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.20<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4620\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular septal defect and Tetralogy of Fallot</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.21<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4621\"> </a></td><td>Complex heart abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.22<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4622\"> </a></td><td>Functionally univentricular heart</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.23<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4623\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle with doubly committed ventricular septal defect</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.24<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4624\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle with intact ventricular septum</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.25<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4625\"> </a></td><td>Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD) + systemic-to-pulmonary collateral artery(ies) (MAPCA(s))</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.26<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4626\"> </a></td><td>Tetralogy of Fallot with pulmonary atresia</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.27<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4627\"> </a></td><td>Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD): aorta from right ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.28<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4628\"> </a></td><td>Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD): aorta from left ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.29<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4629\"> </a></td><td>Pulmonary atresia + virtually intact ventricular septum (tiny ventricular septal defect)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.30<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4630\"> </a></td><td>Congenital heart disease</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.31<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4631\"> </a></td><td>Acyanotic congenital heart disease</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.32<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4632\"> </a></td><td>Cyanotic congenital heart disease</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.33<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4633\"> </a></td><td>Left heart obstruction at multiple sites (including Shone syndrome)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.34<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4634\"> </a></td><td>Congenital cardiovascular abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.35<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4635\"> </a></td><td>Congenital abnormality of cardiac position and-or connections</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.36<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4636\"> </a></td><td>Diagnosis unspecified</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.37<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4637\"> </a></td><td>Other or miscellaneous diagnosis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.38<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4638\"> </a></td><td>Structural developmental anomaly (congenital) of heart and-or great vessels and related acquired abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.39<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4639\"> </a></td><td>Cardiac abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.40<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4640\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle with subaortic or doubly committed ventricular septal defect without pulmonary stenosis, ventricular septal defect type</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.41<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4641\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle with subaortic ventricular septal defect</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.49<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4649\"> </a></td><td>Inadequate systemic &amp; pulmonary mixing in transposition of great arteries physiology</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.50<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4650\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet ventriculo-arterial connections</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.51<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4651\"> </a></td><td>Single outlet ventriculo-arterial connection</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.52<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4652\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet both ventricles</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.55<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4655\"> </a></td><td>Tetralogy of Fallot with pulmonary atresia and native pulmonary arteries present</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.56<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4656\"> </a></td><td>Tetralogy of Fallot with absent pulmonary valve</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.57<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4657\"> </a></td><td>Tetralogy of Fallot with pulmonary atresia and systemic-to-pulmonary collateral artery(ies) (MAPCA(s))</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.59<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4659\"> </a></td><td>Structural developmental anomaly of heart and-or great vessels</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.60<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4660\"> </a></td><td>Vascular abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.61<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4661\"> </a></td><td>Aneurysm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.62<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4662\"> </a></td><td>Heart aneurysm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.63<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4663\"> </a></td><td>Heart wall aneurysm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.64<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4664\"> </a></td><td>Ventricular aneurysm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.65<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4665\"> </a></td><td>Embolus</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.70<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4670\"> </a></td><td>Normal cardiac segments (S-D-S)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.71<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4671\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 1 (Atrial situs): A = Ambiguus (as in isomerism)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.72<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4672\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 1 (Atrial situs): I = Inversus</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.73<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4673\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 1 (Atrial situs): S = Solitus</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.74<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4674\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 1 (Atrial situs): X = unknown or not possible to determine</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.75<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4675\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 3 (relationship of great arteries in space): A = aorta directly anterior to pulmonary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.76<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4676\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 3 (relationship of great arteries in space): D = aorta to the right of the pulmonary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.77<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4677\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature: Letter 3 (relationship of great arteries in space): L = aorta to the left of the pulmonary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.78<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4678\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 3 (relationship of great arteries in space): N = Normal (solitus)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.79<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4679\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 3 (relationship of great arteries in space): S = Solitus (normal)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.80<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4680\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 3 (relationship of great arteries in space) X = unknown or not possible to determine</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.01.81<a name=\"ipccc-01.4601.4681\"> </a></td><td>Segmental nomenclature Letter 3 (relationship of great arteries in space): I = Inversus (mirror image of normal)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.00<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4600\"> </a></td><td>Usual atrial arrangement (atrial situs solitus)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.01<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4601\"> </a></td><td>Mirror image atrial arrangement (atrial situs inversus)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.02<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4602\"> </a></td><td>Isomerism of right atrial appendages</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.03<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4603\"> </a></td><td>Isomerism of left atrial appendages</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.04<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4604\"> </a></td><td>Atrial arrangement (situs) ambiguus (indeterminate)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.06<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4606\"> </a></td><td>Abnormal atrial arrangement</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.07<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4607\"> </a></td><td>Atrial arrangement unknown</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.08<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4608\"> </a></td><td>Isomerism of atrial appendages</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.09<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4609\"> </a></td><td>Congenital anomaly of an atrioventricular and-or ventriculo-arterial connection(s)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.10<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4610\"> </a></td><td>Normal atrial arrangement (situs), atrioventricular &amp; ventriculo-arterial connections</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.11<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4611\"> </a></td><td>Atrial arrangement uncertain</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.12<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4612\"> </a></td><td>Isomerism</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.03.13<a name=\"ipccc-01.4603.4613\"> </a></td><td>Congenital anomaly of cardiac connections</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.00<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4600\"> </a></td><td>Concordant atrioventricular connections</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.01<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4601\"> </a></td><td>Discordant atrioventricular connections</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.02<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4602\"> </a></td><td>Mixed ('ambiguous') atrioventricular connections (biventricular)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.03<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4603\"> </a></td><td>Double inlet right ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.04<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4604\"> </a></td><td>Double inlet left ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.05<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4605\"> </a></td><td>Double inlet to solitary ventricle of indeterminate morphology</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.06<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4606\"> </a></td><td>Left-sided atrium to left ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.07<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4607\"> </a></td><td>Left-sided atrium to right ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.08<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4608\"> </a></td><td>Left-sided atrium to ventricle of indeterminate morphology</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.09<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4609\"> </a></td><td>Right-sided atrium to right ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.04.10<a name=\"ipccc-01.4604.4610\"> </a></td><td>Right-sided atrium to left ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style