arterial connections</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.01<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4601\"> </a></td><td>Transposition of great arteries (discordant ventriculo-arterial connections) (TGA)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.02<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4602\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet right ventricle related abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.03<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4603\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet left ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.04<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4604\"> </a></td><td>Double outlet from ventricle of indeterminate morphology</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.10<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4610\"> </a></td><td>Concordant ventriculo-arterial connections with parallel great arteries (anatomically corrected malposition)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.17<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4617\"> </a></td><td>Ventriculo-arterial connection(s) unknown or unspecified</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.32<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4632\"> </a></td><td>Single outlet ventriculo-arterial connection via aorta (pulmonary atresia)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.33<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4633\"> </a></td><td>Single outlet ventriculo-arterial connection via pulmonary trunk (aortic atresia)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.41<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4641\"> </a></td><td>Single ventricular outlet above both ventricles</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.42<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4642\"> </a></td><td>Single ventricular outlet above right ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.43<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4643\"> </a></td><td>Single ventricular outlet above left ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.44<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4644\"> </a></td><td>Single ventricular outlet above ventricle of indeterminate morphology</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.45<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4645\"> </a></td><td>Single ventricular outlet</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.05.46<a name=\"ipccc-01.4605.4646\"> </a></td><td>Ventricular commitment of ventriculo-arterial artery unknown or unspecified</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.06.01<a name=\"ipccc-01.4606.4601\"> </a></td><td>Two atrioventricular valves in double inlet ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">01.06.02<a name=\"ipccc-01.4606.4602\"> </a></td><td>Common atrioventricular orifice in double inlet ventricle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.00<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4600\"> </a></td><td>Normal position-orientation of heart</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.01<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4601\"> </a></td><td>Extrathoracic heart (ectopia cordis)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.02<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4602\"> </a></td><td>Dextrocardia: heart predominantly in right hemithorax</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.03<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4603\"> </a></td><td>Laevocardia: heart predominantly in left hemithorax</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.04<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4604\"> </a></td><td>Midline heart (mesocardia)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.05<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4605\"> </a></td><td>Heart rotated to right (dextrorotation)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.06<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4606\"> </a></td><td>Heart rotated to left (laevorotation)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.09<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4609\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous position-orientation of heart</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.01.51<a name=\"ipccc-02.4601.4651\"> </a></td><td>Conjoined twins: anterior thoracic union (thoracopagus)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">02.02.00<a name=\"ipccc-02.4602.4600\"> </a></td><td>Apex of heart to left ('laevoversion')</td></tr><tr><td