\"> </a></td><td>Right atrium normal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.00.11<a name=\"ipccc-05.4600.4611\"> </a></td><td>Right atrium normal size</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.00.12<a name=\"ipccc-05.4600.4612\"> </a></td><td>Left atrium normal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.00.13<a name=\"ipccc-05.4600.4613\"> </a></td><td>Left atrium normal size</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.00.14<a name=\"ipccc-05.4600.4614\"> </a></td><td>Right ventricle normal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.00.15<a name=\"ipccc-05.4600.4615\"> </a></td><td>Right ventricle normal size</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.00.16<a name=\"ipccc-05.4600.4616\"> </a></td><td>Left ventricle normal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.00.17<a name=\"ipccc-05.4600.4617\"> </a></td><td>Left ventricle normal size</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.00<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4600\"> </a></td><td>Right atrial abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.02<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4602\"> </a></td><td>Eustachian valve prominent (anomalous valve of inferior caval vein (IVC))</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.03<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4603\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous valve of coronary sinus (Thebesian valve)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.04<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4604\"> </a></td><td>Filigreed network of venous valves (Chiari)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.05<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4605\"> </a></td><td>Right atrial appendage absent</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.06<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4606\"> </a></td><td>Left-sided juxtaposition of the atrial appendages</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.07<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4607\"> </a></td><td>Right atrial appendage aneurysm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.08<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4608\"> </a></td><td>Right atrial dilation</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.09<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4609\"> </a></td><td>Right atrial hypoplasia</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.10<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4610\"> </a></td><td>Right atrial hypertrophy</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.11<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4611\"> </a></td><td>Primary right atrial endocardial fibroelastosis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.12<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4612\"> </a></td><td>Congenital giant right atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.13<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4613\"> </a></td><td>Congenital anomaly of right atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.21<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4621\"> </a></td><td>Divided right atrium (obstructive Eustachian valve) (cor triatriatum dexter)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.22<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4622\"> </a></td><td>Eustachian valve prolapsing through tricuspid valve</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.23<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4623\"> </a></td><td>Eustachian valve prolapsing through atrial septum</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.24<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4624\"> </a></td><td>Absence of coronary sinus (Thebesian) valve</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.25<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4625\"> </a></td><td>Prolapse of Eustachian valve</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.01.26<a name=\"ipccc-05.4601.4626\"> </a></td><td>Persistence of left venous valve</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.00<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4600\"> </a></td><td>Left atrial abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.01<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4601\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.02<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4602\"> </a></td><td>Supravalvar or intravalvar mitral ring</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.03<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4603\"> </a></td><td>Left atrial appendage absent</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.04<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4604\"> </a></td><td>Right-sided juxtaposition of the atrial appendages</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.05<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4605\"> </a></td><td>Left atrial appendage aneurysm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.06<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4606\"> </a></td><td>Left atrial dilation</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.07<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4607\"> </a></td><td>Left atrial hypoplasia</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.08<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4608\"> </a></td><td>Left atrial hypertrophy</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.09<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4609\"> </a></td><td>Primary left atrial endocardial fibroelastosis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.10<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4610\"> </a></td><td>Giant left atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.11<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4611\"> </a></td><td>Congenital anomaly of left atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.21<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4621\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - all pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to distal chamber of left atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.22<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4622\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - all pulmonary veins to proximal chamber draining to distal chamber of left atrium + additional pulmonary venous chamber communication</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.23<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4623\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - all pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to distal chamber of left atrium + proximal chamber communication to right atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.24<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4624\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - all pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to distal chamber of left atrium + proximal chamber extracardiac communication</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.25<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4625\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - all pulmonary veins to proximal chamber but not to distal chamber of left atrium (imperforate)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.26<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4626\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - all pulmonary veins to proximal chamber but not to distal chamber of left atrium (imperforate) + proximal chamber communication to right atrium (total anomalous pulmonary venous drainage)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.27<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4627\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - all pulmonary veins to proximal chamber but not to distal chamber of left atrium (imperforate) + proximal chamber extracardiac communication</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.28<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4628\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - some pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to distal chamber of left atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.29<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4629\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) related abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.30<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4630\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - some pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to distal chamber of left atrium + other veins normal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.31<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4631\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - some pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to distal chamber of left atrium + other veins anomalous (PAPVC)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.32<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4632\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - outlet of proximal chamber to distal chamber of left atrium restrictive</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.33<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4633\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - outlet of proximal chamber to distal chamber of left atrium non-restrictive</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.34<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4634\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - some pulmonary veins to proximal chamber</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.35<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4635\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - some pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to right atrium</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.36<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4636\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - some pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to right atrium + other veins normal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.02.37<a name=\"ipccc-05.4602.4637\"> </a></td><td>Divided left atrium (cor triatriatum) - some pulmonary veins to proximal chamber &amp; then to right atrium + other veins anomalous (PAPVC)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.03.00<a name=\"ipccc-05.4603.4600\"> </a></td><td>Atrial septum abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.03.01<a name=\"ipccc-05.4603.4601\"> </a></td><td>Patent foramen ovale (PFO)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.03.02<a name=\"ipccc-05.4603.4602\"> </a></td><td>Premature closure of foramen ovale</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.03.03<a name=\"ipccc-05.4603.4603\"> </a></td><td>Aneurysm of the atrial septum</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.03.04<a name=\"ipccc-05.4603.4604\"> </a></td><td>Spontaneous closure of foramen ovale</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">05.03.05<a name=\"ipccc-05.4603.4605\"> </a></td><td>Restrictive interatrial communication ('ASD') in the presence of an obligatory interatria