4630.4631\"> </a></td><td>Common origin of brachiocephalic trunk (innominate artery) &amp; left common carotid artery ('Bovine arch')</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.30.32<a name=\"ipccc-09.4630.4632\"> </a></td><td>Left common carotid artery arising from brachiocephalic trunk (innominate artery)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.30.33<a name=\"ipccc-09.4630.4633\"> </a></td><td>Congenital tortuosity of branch(es) of aortic arch</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.30.34<a name=\"ipccc-09.4630.4634\"> </a></td><td>Aberrant origin of brachiocephalic trunk (innominate artery)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.00<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4600\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.01<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4601\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring with left aortic arch</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.02<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4602\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; right arterial duct from aberrant retroesophageal right subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.03<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4603\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; right arterial duct from retroesophageal aortic diverticulum + aberrant right subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.04<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4604\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; right arterial duct from aberrant retroesophageal brachiocephalic trunk (innominate artery)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.05<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4605\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; right arterial duct from retroesophageal aortic diverticulum (Kommerell)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.07<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4607\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left patent arterial duct</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.08<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4608\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial ligament</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.09<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4609\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial ligament between left subclavian and left carotid arteries</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.10<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4610\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring with left aortic arch</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.11<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4611\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring with right aortic arch</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.12<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4612\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial duct from aberrant retroesophageal left subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.13<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4613\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial duct from retroesophageal aortic diverticulum + aberrant left subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.14<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4614\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial duct from aberrant retroesophageal brachiocephalic trunk (innominate artery)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.15<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4615\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left duct from retroesophageal aortic diverticulum (Kommerell)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.17<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4617\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial duct from retroesophageal aortic diverticulum &amp; isolated left subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.18<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4618\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring with right aortic arch</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.19<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4619\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial ligament with left descending 'circumflex' aorta</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.20<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4620\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch with mirror image branching &amp; left arterial ligament</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.21<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4621\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring due to aberrant subclavian artery &amp; bilateral arterial ducts</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.22<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4622\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring related abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.23<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4623\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left arch + retroesophageal right descending aorta + right arterial duct from aortic diverticulum + aberrant right subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.24<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4624\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; right patent arterial duct</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.25<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4625\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; right arterial ligament</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.26<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4626\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; right arterial ligament with absent left pulmonary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.27<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4627\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; right patent arterial duct with absent left pulmonary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.28<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4628\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; retrotracheal right patent arterial duct (ductal sling)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.29<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4629\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial ligament with aberrant retroesophageal left subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.30<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4630\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch &amp; right arterial duct-ligament from retroesophageal aortic diverticulum (Kommerell) with aberrant right subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.31<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4631\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch with right descending aorta &amp; right arterial ligament</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.32<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4632\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: left aortic arch with right descending aorta &amp; right patent arterial duct</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.33<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4633\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring: right aortic arch &amp; left arterial ligament with left descending 'circumflex' aorta + aberrant retroesophageal left subclavian artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.34<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4634\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring of left aortic arch and right arterial duct or ligament</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.35<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4635\"> </a></td><td>Vascular ring of right aortic arch and left arterial duct or ligament</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.31.40<a name=\"ipccc-09.4631.4640\"> </a></td><td>Tracheo-esophageal compressive syndrome</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.01<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4601\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of coronary artery from pulmonary arterial tree</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.02<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4602\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of right coronary artery from pulmonary artery (ARCAPA)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.03<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4603\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of left coronary artery from pulmonary artery (ALCAPA)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.04<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4604\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of coronary artery from pulmonary artery - anterior interventricular (left anterior descending)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.05<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4605\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of coronary artery from pulmonary artery - circumflex</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.06<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4606\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of coronary artery from pulmonary artery - both coronary arteries</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.07<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4607\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of coronary artery from pulmonary artery - accessory coronary</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.41.08<a name=\"ipccc-09.4641.4608\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous origin of coronary artery from pulmonary artery related abnormality</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.42.00<a name=\"ipccc-09.4642.4600\"> </a></td><td>Anomalous aortic origin or course of coronary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.42.01<a name=\"ipccc-09.4642.4601\"> </a></td><td>Coronary artery arising from non-facing aortic sinus (Sinus 3)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.42.02<a name=\"ipccc-09.4642.4602\"> </a></td><td>Left and right coronary arteries arising with dual orifices from aortic sinus to right of nonfacing aortic sinus (Sinus 1)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.42.03<a name=\"ipccc-09.4642.4603\"> </a></td><td>Left coronary artery arising from aortic sinus to right of nonfacing aortic sinus (Sinus 1); right coronary artery from aortic sinus to left of nonfacing aortic sinus (Sinus 2) (usual)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.42.04<a name=\"ipccc-09.4642.4604\"> </a></td><td>Anterior interventricular (left anterior descending) artery arising from aortic sinus to right of nonfacing aortic sinus (Sinus 1); circumflex &amp; right coronary arteries from aortic sinus to left of nonfacing aortic sinus (Sinus 2)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.42.05<a name=\"ipccc-09.4642.4605\"> </a></td><td>Left and right coronary arteries arising with dual orifices from aortic s