eft coronary giving right branch running posterior to great vessels</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.28<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4628\"> </a></td><td>Single coronary: left coronary giving right branch running between great vessels</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.29<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4629\"> </a></td><td>Single coronary: right coronary giving left branch running anterior to great vessels</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.30<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4630\"> </a></td><td>Coronary arterial supply to conduction system abnormal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.31<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4631\"> </a></td><td>Sinus node artery from right coronary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.32<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4632\"> </a></td><td>Sinus node artery from circumflex artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.33<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4633\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular nodal artery from right coronary artery</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.34<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4634\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular nodal artery from circumflex artery extending to the crux</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.37<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4637\"> </a></td><td>Single coronary: right coronary giving left branch running posterior to great vessels</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.43.38<a name=\"ipccc-09.4643.4638\"> </a></td><td>Single coronary: right coronary giving left branch running between great vessels</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.44.00<a name=\"ipccc-09.4644.4600\"> </a></td><td>Normal coronary arterial orifice position</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.44.01<a name=\"ipccc-09.4644.4601\"> </a></td><td>Abnormal coronary arterial orifice position</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">09.44.02<a name=\"ipccc-09.4644.4602\"> </a></td><td>Coronary arterial orifice abnormally high (above sin