rap\">11.07.23<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4623\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular reentry (reciprocating) tachycardia: antidromic (typically wide QRS)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.24<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4624\"> </a></td><td>Atrial fibrillation with preexcitation</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.25<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4625\"> </a></td><td>Atrial flutter with preexcitation</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.26<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4626\"> </a></td><td>Multiple accessory pathways</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.27<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4627\"> </a></td><td>Accessory pathway: antegrade &amp; retrograde conduction (preexcitation sinus rhythm)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.28<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4628\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular reentry (reciprocating) tachycardia: orthodromic &amp; antidromic</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.29<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4629\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular reentry (reciprocating) tachycardia (accessory pathway mediated)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.30<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4630\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular reentry (reciprocating) tachycardia: manifest preexcitation in sinus rhythm (Wolff Parkinson White): symptomatic</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.31<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4631\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular reentry (reciprocating) tachycardia: manifest preexcitation in sinus rhythm: asymptomatic</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.32<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4632\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular reentry (reciprocating) tachycardia: orthodromic (typically narrow QRS): concealed (no preexcitation in sinus rhythm)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">11.07.33<a name=\"ipccc-11.4607.4633\"> </a></td><td>Atrioventricular reentry (reciprocating) tachycardia (typically narrow QRS): orthodromic: manifest (preexcitation in sinus rhythm)</td></tr><